{{Quote|I'm not really from anywhere. My father was a pro-racer. Always going from one system to the next.|Tamara Ryvora, to Synara San|audio=TamsFather-SynarasScore.flac|<ref name="Synara's Score" />}}
A [[Gender|male]] '''individual''' was the [[Parent|father]] of the [[human]] [[Tamara Ryvora]]. He<ref name="Ace Squadron" /> was a famous<ref name="USWNE">''[[Ultimate Star Wars, New Edition]]''</ref> [[racer]] on the [[planet]] [[Kuat]]<ref name="Ace Squadron" /> and traveled with his [[Tamara Ryvora's family|daughter]] from [[Star system|system]] to system, competing in races.<ref name="Synara's Score" /> Her father's occupation inspired Ryvora to leave her [[homeworld]] to pursue a racing career.<ref name="Ace Squadron" /> In [[34 ABY]],<ref name="34 ABY">{{ResistanceDate|1|8}}</ref> Ryvora recounted her childhood with her father to the secret-[[pirate]] [[Synara San]].<ref name="Synara's Score" />

==Behind the scenes==
Tamara Ryvora's father was first mentioned in "[[Synara's Score]],"<ref name="Synara's Score" /> the eighth episode of the [[Star Wars Resistance Season One|first season]] of the animated television series ''[[Star Wars Resistance]]'', which aired on [[November 18]], [[2018]].<ref name="Disney release">{{DisneyPress|wdtv=1|url=disneychannel/shows/star-wars-resistance/episodes|text=Star Wars Resistance}}</ref> The scene that mentioned Ryvora's father was included in a preview for the episode, which was posted on the official ''[[Star Wars]]'' [[Wikipedia:YouTube|YouTube]] channel [[November 14|four days prior]] to the episode's release.<ref name="YouTube">{{SWYouTube|oWCusKm0NOo|Tam's Story- "Synara's Score" Preview &#124; Star Wars Resistance|date=2018-11-14}}</ref> [[Brandon Auman]],<ref name="Wook">{{WookYouTube|ML1nYpSU0d0|Wookieepedia Interviews - Brandon Auman|date=2024-11-11}}</ref> executive producer and head writer for ''Star Wars Resistance'',<ref name="Writer">{{SWYouTube|dlucTaqVVcs|Meet Team Fireball &#124; Star Wars Resistance|sw_url=video/meet-team-fireball-star-wars-resistance|date=2018-08-29}}</ref> felt the father's relationship with the [[Galactic Empire]]&mdash;with which Ryvora's family worked for&mdash;was not understood by Ryvora to be a bad thing.<ref name="Wook" />

